  "body": "I apologize if this has already been discussed before, but it would be extremely useful to have a timestamp property, or perhaps createTime, on the notification object. A scenario I am thinking is when a page wants to manually expire notifications that have been around for a certain amount of time (without the user making any action to dismiss them). Cross-global notifications make this difficult.\n",
